<title>SPAIN: SPAIN 6-MO T-BILL YIELD RISES AT AUCTION.</title>
<headline>SPAIN 6-MO T-BILL YIELD RISES AT AUCTION.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at today's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p>ISSUE Yield Pvs Price Pvs Bid Allocated</p>
<p>  6-mo  5.106   5.071    97.47   97.50  218.30  121.75</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
